#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:121
msgid ""
"Create an SDK context and register the transfer context, pass it to every"
" other call."
msgstr "创建一个 SDK 上下文并注册传输上下文，将其传递给每个其他调用。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:123
msgid "``lmc_sdk.close(ctx)``"
msgstr "``lmc_sdk.close(ctx)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:124
msgid "Close the context and release resources. Called when done with the SDK."
msgstr "关闭上下文并释放资源。在完成 SDK 的使用时调用。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:125
msgid ""
"``lmc_stream.create_request(ctx, post_completion, prompt_token_ids, "
"cache_salt=\"\")``"
msgstr "``lmc_stream.create_request(ctx, post_completion, prompt_token_ids, cache_salt=\"\")``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:127
msgid "Create one request stream to add to a batch."
msgstr "创建一个请求流以添加到批处理中。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:128
msgid "``lmc_batch.LMCacheBatchedStream()``"
msgstr "``lmc_batch.LMCacheBatchedStream()``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:129
msgid "Create an empty batch."
msgstr "创建一个空批次。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:130
msgid "``batch.add(stream)``"
msgstr "``batch.add(stream)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:131
msgid "Register a stream to the batch."
msgstr "将流注册到批处理中。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:132
msgid "``batch.prefill(sampling_params)``"
msgstr "``batch.prefill(sampling_params)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:133
msgid ""
"Prefill every stream once (``max_tokens`` forced to 1). Returns a "
"``Metrics`` report."
msgstr "一次 Prefill 每个流（``max_tokens`` 强制为 1）。返回一个 ``Metrics`` 报告。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:135
msgid "``batch.modify(fn)``"
msgstr "``batch.modify(fn)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:136
msgid ""
"Apply the edit function ``fn`` to every stream's cached KV. Returns a "
"``Metrics`` report."
msgstr "将编辑函数 ``fn`` 应用到每个流的缓存 KV。返回一个 ``Metrics`` 报告。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:138
msgid "``batch.decode(sampling_params)``"
msgstr "``batch.decode(sampling_params)``"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:139
msgid "Decode every stream. Returns a ``Metrics`` report."
msgstr "解码每个流。返回一个 ``Metrics`` 报告。"

#: ../../source/mp/sdk.rst:141
msgid ""
"```Metrics`` returns ``input_tokens``, ``input_tput`` for prefill, "
"``duration`` for modify, and ``output_tokens``, ``output_tput`` for "
"decode."
msgstr "```Metrics``` 返回 ``input_tokens``、``input_tput`` 用于 Prefill，``duration`` 用于修改，以及 ``output_tokens``、``output_tput`` 用于解码。"

